---
version: 2.0.2
title: JSON errors
file: ./test/margot_test.gleam
test_name: json_error_test
---
- syntax.i18n.json: unexpected `}`
- end.i18n.json: unexpected end of input
- trailing.i18n.json: unexpected `{`
- empty.i18n.json: unexpected end of input
- root.i18n.json: the file should be a map of translations, found a list
- number.i18n.json: `count`: the value is an integer, expected a string or a map (quote it to keep it as text)
- number.i18n.json: `null`: the value is empty, expected a string or a map
- nested.i18n.json: `group.list`: the value is a list, expected a string or a map (quote it to keep it as text)
